# Quickshell shell (bar + OSDs) — held behind features.quickshell_shell while
# it is built out phase by phase. Waybar keeps running throughout; flipping the
# flag to true and running `chezmoi apply` is the whole rollout, and flipping it
# back is the whole rollback. Both Hyprland entry points glob conf.d and
# tolerate absence, so an undeployed drop-in is simply never sourced.
#
# The gate lives here rather than in the drop-ins because a .lua/.conf file
# cannot carry template actions, and .chezmoidata files cannot be templates
# (see .claude/rules/chezmoi-data.md). Roadmap: _plans/QUICKSHELL_SHELL.md
{{ if not .features.quickshell_shell.enabled }}
.config/hypr/conf.d/quickshell.lua
.config/hypr/conf.d/quickshell.conf
.config/quickshell
{{ end }}

# Steam iGPU-forcing desktop override only makes sense on hybrid-GPU laptops
